%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: H11_X2_2_1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: I should just ignore them. It's more important that Mr. Horse is okay right
      now.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I follow him to the other room and see him grabbing a towel to wipe off
      the sweat from his forehead. He lets out a deep breath and rests against a
      railing by the wall. I cautiously approach him.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I'm sorry about all of this, Mr. Horse. This all went a bit different than
      expected.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "I am not used to this. I wish I could return to my peaceful life amongst
      my sort\u2014or at least turn invisible again."
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 1
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I can understand that. Humans can be weird and mean.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: You are not, at least.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: That's nice of him to say. I'm glad he feels this way.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I simply smile at him. He pats off some beads of sweat that have formed
      on his neck.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I feel quite hot. Or perhaps I simply need a cool down from the exercise.
      You would not mind me taking off my shirt, would you?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Umm\u2026 Would I mind? Yes, I mean\u2026 No! What? Horses don't even
      usually wear shirts so why would I mind?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: That's fine.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I see Mr. Horse sliding his fingers under the hem of the shirt. After that,
      I turn my head to face away from him.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I can't watch this.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Why not?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I am just being respectful; there's nothing more to it.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Right?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Are you certain you do not mind?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Yes.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Why are you turning your back on me then?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I guess I can turn back around, if he wants me to. I want to. I mean, I
      don't mind either way.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I try not to stare, but what is facing me makes it damn near impossible.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Those muscles\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Is something wrong?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Defined pecs, hard abs, full biceps\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I notice I haven't said anything in a while. I separate my eyes from Mr
      Horse's toned body and glance back up at his face with a perplexed look.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Oh no, I must look like a perv right now. What do I say? Wait, did he ask
      me something?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Uhh\u2026 yes?"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: There is? What's the matter?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I don't think that was the correct answer.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Sorry, no. I don't know. Everything's good.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c017f2dc9f1c531439bd28453439c861, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bc021eefc444450b8981141f68a95d99, type: 2}
